    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavide wayenazo zonke izinduna zakwa-Israyeli, izinduna zezizwe nezinduna zezigaba ezikhonza inkosi, nezinduna zezinkulungwane, nezinduna zamakhulu, nababonisi bazo zonke izimpahla nempahla yenkosi, nabanye. Emadodaneni akhe, nababonisi, nabanye bamaqhawe, nawo onke amaqhawe, kwaze kwaba seJerusalema.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkosi uDavida yasisukuma yathi: Ngizweni, bafowethu labantu bami! isenabelo sezinyawo zikaNkulunkulu wethu, salungiselelwa ukwakha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uNkulunkulu wathi kimi: Kawuyikwakhela ibizo lami indlu, ngoba wawuyiqhawe, wachitha igazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepha uJehova uNkulunkulu ka-Israyeli wangikhetha phezu kwayo yonke indlu kababa ukuba ngibe yinkosi kwa-Israyeli kuze kube phakade, ngokuba wakhetha uJuda ukuba abe ngumbusi; nendlu kaJuda, indlu kababa; futhi phakathi kwamadodana kababa wayethanda ukuthi ngizenze inkosi phezu kukaIsrayeli wonke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwo wonke amadodana ami, ngokuba uJehova wangipha amadodana amaningi, wakhetha uSolomoni indodana yami ukuba ahlale esihlalweni sobukhosi sombuso kaJehova kwa-Israyeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi kimi: USolomoni indodana yakho, nguyena oyakwakha indlu yami namagceke ami, ngokuba ngimkhethile ukuba abe yindodana yami, mina ngibe nguyise kuyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngiyakuqinisa umbuso wakhe kuze kube phakade, uma ephikelela ukwenza imiyalo yami nezimiso zami njenganamuhla.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho-ke, phambi kwamehlo ka-Israyeli wonke, bambani umhlangano kaJehova nasezindlebeni zikaNkulunkulu wethu, nifune yonke imiyalo kaJehova uNkulunkulu wenu, ukuze nilidle leli zwe elihle, nilisebenzise. Kube ‘yifa labantwana bakho kuze kube phakade emva kwakho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wena-ke, ndodana yami, Solomoni, yazi wena uNkulunkulu kayihlo, umkhonze ngenhliziyo epheleleyo langengqondo evumayo; ngokuba uJehova uhlola zonke izinhliziyo, uqonda yonke imicabango yemicabango; uma nimfuna, niyotholwa; kepha uma umshiya, uyakukulahla kuze kube phakade.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qaphelani manje; ngokuba uJehova ukukhethile ukuba wakhe indlu yendlu engcwele; qina ukwenze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UDavida wasenika uSolomoni indodana yakhe isibonelo sevaranda, lezindlu zakhe, lengcebo yakhe, leamakamelo akhe angaphezulu, lamakamelo akhe angaphakathi, lendawo yesihlalo somusa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nesibonelo sakho konke ayenakho ngomoya, samagceke endlu kaJehova, nesawo wonke amakamelo nxazonke, nengcebo yendlu kaNkulunkulu, neyengcebo yezipho ezingcwele;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nezigaba zabapristi namaLevi nezawo wonke umsebenzi wenkonzo yendlu kaJehova nezazo zonke izinto zenkonzo yendlu kaJehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanika igolide ngesisindo sezinto zegolide, lazo zonke izinto zokusebenza zenkonzo yonke; nesiliva lazo zonke izinto zesiliva ngesisindo, lazo zonke izitsha zenkonzo yenkonzo;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isisindo sezinti zezibani zegolide nezibani zazo zegolide ngokwesisindo salolo luthi lwesibani nezibani zalo; nezinti zezibani zesiliva ngesisindo sothi lwezibani nezibani zalo njengomsebenzi walolo nalolo luthi lwesibani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
