        },
        {
          "text": "negolide elicwengekileyo lamagumbi enyama, nezitsha, nezindebe; nezitsha zegolide ngesisindo sezitsha ngazinye; nenani lesiliva ngesisindo sawo wonke umcengezi wesiliva.",
          "type": "text",
