              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Konke lokho,” kusho uDavide, “uJehova wangiqondisa ngokulotshwa ngesandla sakhe phezu kwami, zonke izenzo zalesi sibonelo.",
          "type": "text",
