        },
        {
          "text": "UDavide wayesethi kuSolomoni indodana yakhe: “Qina, ume isibindi, ukwenze; ungesabi, ungapheli amandla, ngokuba uJehova uNkulunkulu, uNkulunkulu wami, unawe; akayikukuyeka, akushiye, uze uqede wonke umsebenzi wenkonzo yendlu kaJehova.",
